#: antispamwizard.cpp:809
msgid "Classify messages manually as spam"
msgstr "Clasificar as mensaxes manualmente coma lixo"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:811
msgid ""
"Sometimes messages are classified wrongly or even not at all; the latter might "
"be by intention, because you perhaps filter out messages from mailing lists "
"before you let the anti-spam tools classify the rest of the messages. You can "
"correct these wrong or missing classifications manually by using the "
"appropriate toolbar buttons which trigger special filters created by this "
"wizard."
msgstr ""
"Algunhas veces as mensaxes calsifícanse mal ou mesmo non de todo; o derradeiro "
"podería ser por intención, porque quizabes filtre as mensaxes das listas de "
"correo-e antes de permitir que as ferramentas de filtraxe as clasifiquen co "
"resto das mensaxes. Pode correo estas clasificacións erróneas ou inexistentes "
"manualmente empregando os botóns axeitados da barra de ferramentas que "
"priorizan os filtros creados por este asistente."

#: antispamwizard.cpp:820
msgid "Classify messages using the anti-spam tools"
msgstr "Clasificar as mensaxes empregando as ferramentas anticorreo-lixo"

#: antispamwizard.cpp:822
msgid ""
"Let the anti-spam tools classify your messages. The wizard will create "
"appropriate filters. The messages are usually marked by the tools so that "
"following filters can react on this and, for example, move spam messages to a "
"special folder."
msgstr ""
